{"id": "unknown-2026-06-23-037", "date": "2026-06-23", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Dinto Solar launches 775 W heterojunction PV module with 25.0% efficiency", "content": "<p>Chinese manufacturer Dinto Solar will debut its new DT198G-FZ HJT solar module for utility-scale applications at the Intersolar tradeshow in Munich. The zero-barbus (0BB), 1/3-cut cell panel delivers up to 775 W of power with 25.05% efficiency, featuring a 98% bifaciality rate and 90.3% power retention after 30 years.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/23/dinto-solar-launches-775-w-heterojunction-pv-module-with-25-0-efficiency/\">Dinto Solar launches 775 W heterojunct", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/23/dinto-solar-launches-775-w-heterojunction-pv-module-with-25-0-efficiency/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-23-038", "date": "2026-06-23", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cathode_material"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ATW launches 1.3 GW encapsulation turnkey solution for heterojunction solar modules", "content": "<p>Wuxi Autowell (ATW) has launched a 1.3 GW fully integrated intelligent heterojunction (HJT) module encapsulation line built around 0BB stringing, automated layup, and energy-efficient lamination. The system targets lower-cost, low-stress HJT production by reducing silver use, enabling low-temperature interconnection, and integrating AGV-driven automation with data-based process and lifecycle support.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/23/atw-launches-1-3-gw-encapsula", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/23/atw-launches-1-3-gw-encapsulation-turnkey-solution-for-heterojunction-solar-modules/", "type": "rss"}]}
